WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.625
In the previous verse, 
Lord Shri Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:36.541
that after being established
in His supreme abode,

3
00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:39.250
the soul doesn't take rebirth.

4
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.583
Now in this verse, this question
 may arise in Arjuna's mind –

5
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.416
is there any place

6
00:00:43.416 --> 00:00:44.875
in the material world

7
00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:49.166
that's an exception to this rule?

8
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:50.958
Shri Krishna clarifies

9
00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:54.500
that the entire material 
world is residence of suffering.

10
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.291
He also explains what kind

11
00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:59.083
of suffering it is.

12
00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:06.458
Moving forward from previous verses,

13
00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:07.500
Lord Shri Krishna

14
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.083
emphasizes the supremacy
 of attaining His abode.

15
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.916
By repeating the phrase

16
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:15.916
'mām upetya,'

17
00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:17.666
He establishes that 

18
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:19.708
attaining Him is life's

19
00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:22.291
supreme goal.

20
00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:25.041
Shri Krishna cautions us not to be attracted

21
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:28.083
by the material world's pleasures,

22
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.750
even if those pleasures are found

23
00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:33.208
in the highest realms like Brahmaloka.

24
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:34.583
He clarifies

25
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:39.333
that every corner of the material world is

26
00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:42.625
'duḥkhālayam aśāśvatam' – 
a place of suffering and impermanence.

27
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:45.000
In the next verses, He'll explain in detail

28
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.333
how attaining the Lord's abode is possible.

29
00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:51.416
But here He determines

30
00:01:51.416 --> 00:01:52.916
that all realms,

31
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:56.375
from highest to lowest, are impermanent.

32
00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:58.666
Even those who reach Brahmaloka

33
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:00.208
remain 'punar āvartino' –

34
00:02:00.208 --> 00:02:01.166
bound in the

35
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:05.000
cycle of birth and death.

36
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.416
In contrast, those who

37
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:08.708
remember Shri Krishna with devotion

38
00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:13.250
attain 'paramāṁ gataḥ,' 
meaning the supreme destination,

39
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:18.416
and become forever free
from the bondage of rebirth.

40
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:20.666
Higher realms like Brahmaloka and heaven

41
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:22.666
are obtained not through devotion

42
00:02:22.666 --> 00:02:24.666
but as fruits of

43
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:26.250
virtuous actions.

44
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:30.166
These enjoyments there, though not sinful,

45
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:34.041
are distracting from the path of pure devotion.

46
00:02:34.041 --> 00:02:37.166
Therefore, Lord Shri Krishna suggests the path

47
00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:38.916
of practicing pure devotion

48
00:02:38.916 --> 00:02:40.208
on this earth

49
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:43.875
to directly attain His eternal abode,

50
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:48.166
thus avoiding the momentary attraction

51
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:49.791
of heavenly pleasures.

52
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:59.750
Have you ever thought that
 even the world's richest

53
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.041
or most famous

54
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:05.125
people aren't untouched by suffering?

55
00:03:05.125 --> 00:03:07.458
In human life, everyone

56
00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.750
experiences suffering,

57
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.041
no matter how much

58
00:03:12.041 --> 00:03:16.250
wealth or honor they have.

59
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.291
I've explained

60
00:03:18.291 --> 00:03:21.541
that this material world, from highest

61
00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:27.166
to lowest realm, is 'duḥkhālayam aśāśvatam' –

62
00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:30.541
temporary residence of suffering.

63
00:03:30.541 --> 00:03:33.916
Don't consider yourself superior or inferior

64
00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:39.083
by comparing yourself with others. Look –

65
00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:42.708
those who seem to have everything

66
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:46.666
are also trapped in the cycle of 

67
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:50.916
mental pressure, loss, and constant change.

68
00:03:50.916 --> 00:03:53.250
You know, day and night

69
00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:57.583
come and go in sequence.

70
00:03:57.583 --> 00:04:01.125
Just as due to earth's geography, nights

71
00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:04.500
are short in some places, long in others,

72
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.291
similarly sometimes the
 period of happiness is long,

73
00:04:08.291 --> 00:04:10.750
sometimes the period of sorrow.

74
00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:14.250
But both periods certainly exist.

75
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.750
Therefore, instead of getting
 entangled in comparison,

76
00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.500
focus on your

77
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.916
spiritual journey.

78
00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:25.250
Life's purpose isn't measuring success

79
00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.750
by material standards,

80
00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:30.958
rather it's obtaining liberation
 from this temporary world.

81
00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:33.083
Understand this world

82
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:34.291
like an ideal

83
00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:39.125
hospital, where the purpose

84
00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:41.083
isn't seeing the patient's affluence

85
00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:43.916
or social status,

86
00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.708
rather focusing on their treatment

87
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:50.333
and health recovery.

88
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:53.833
Similarly, spiritual practice

89
00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:57.291
is medicine for the soul.

90
00:04:57.291 --> 00:05:01.916
It works equally for everyone,

91
00:05:01.916 --> 00:05:06.916
whatever their financial or social status.

92
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:09.375
Spiritual practice

93
00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:12.916
is that life-saving protective garment

94
00:05:12.916 --> 00:05:16.875
that saves you from drowning in the tides 

95
00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:20.791
of happiness and sorrow in life's ocean

96
00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:25.166
and definitely brings you
 to the supreme abode's shore.

97
00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:34.416
The higher tree branches grow,

98
00:05:34.416 --> 00:05:37.125
the more support they need

99
00:05:37.125 --> 00:05:40.333
from roots.

100
00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:42.625
In family life,

101
00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:45.791
focusing on financial progress is necessary.

102
00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:48.833
But believing that

103
00:05:48.833 --> 00:05:52.666
wealth alone will bring security and happiness

104
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:56.541
ultimately becomes cause of suffering.

105
00:05:56.541 --> 00:05:59.875
Although taking care of material needs

106
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:04.375
is important, remember that ultimately

107
00:06:04.375 --> 00:06:09.083
everything ends with time.

108
00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.000
However much you accumulate,

109
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.000
it cannot change this truth

110
00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.375
that this world is perishable.

111
00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:21.166
Think about life's real

112
00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:24.416
challenge, which is 

113
00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:31.208
'the continuously running cycle
 of birth and death!'

114
00:06:31.208 --> 00:06:32.875
Are you

115
00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:35.083
and your family

116
00:06:35.083 --> 00:06:38.958
prepared for this journey?

117
00:06:38.958 --> 00:06:40.500
Just as river's water

118
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.375
remains constantly flowing,

119
00:06:43.375 --> 00:06:48.166
similarly life is also constantly changing.

120
00:06:48.166 --> 00:06:51.083
No material thing,

121
00:06:51.083 --> 00:06:54.583
however valuable,

122
00:06:54.583 --> 00:06:57.125
is permanent.

123
00:06:57.125 --> 00:07:00.833
Spending your entire time and energy

124
00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:06.250
on material gains won't solve this problem.

125
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.833
Death

126
00:07:07.833 --> 00:07:11.000
can come at any moment,

127
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.166
without considering age, health,

128
00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:16.125
or status.

129
00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:20.750
Inspire your family not only
 toward financial stability

130
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:21.750
but also

131
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:26.041
toward spiritual development.

132
00:07:26.041 --> 00:07:28.416
Take out time for prayer, chanting names,

133
00:07:28.416 --> 00:07:32.958
and discussion of eternal truth.

134
00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:34.500
Just as a tree

135
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:38.208
gives its fruits in selfless spirit,

136
00:07:38.208 --> 00:07:41.583
similarly develop the feeling of giving

137
00:07:41.583 --> 00:07:47.583
love and sacrifice in selfless spirit in the family.

138
00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:51.541
The family based on spiritual values

139
00:07:51.541 --> 00:07:56.750
always remains filled with peace and joy,

140
00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.583
where every member

141
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:02.625
moves forward on the path of liberation.

142
00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:12.333
Do you think promotion in the office

143
00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:17.666
can truly bring inner peace?

144
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:19.375
In the work world, this idea

145
00:08:19.375 --> 00:08:23.750
is common that when you 
obtain a higher position,

146
00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.333
then you can rest and become free

147
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:30.250
from mental pressure.

148
00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.291
But

149
00:08:32.291 --> 00:08:34.375
this is an illusion.

150
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:36.958
At every level, new challenges

151
00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:39.166
and pressures come.

152
00:08:39.166 --> 00:08:40.791
Just as ocean's pressure

153
00:08:40.791 --> 00:08:45.708
increases with increasing depth,
 similarly at higher positions

154
00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:50.083
responsibilities and expectations increase.

155
00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:52.291
Just as I've explained that

156
00:08:52.291 --> 00:08:54.625
all realms of this world,

157
00:08:54.625 --> 00:08:58.250
even the highest realms, are places

158
00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.750
of struggle,

159
00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.875
similarly every office position

160
00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:05.750
has its specific difficulties.

161
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:11.291
The ant understands the ant's 
burden and the elephant understands

162
00:09:11.291 --> 00:09:12.541
the elephant's!

163
00:09:12.541 --> 00:09:14.875
If you continuously expect

164
00:09:14.875 --> 00:09:18.500
some title or authority for peace,

165
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.625
then you'll get only momentary happiness,

166
00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:24.333
not real peace.

167
00:09:24.333 --> 00:09:28.375
Instead of this, focus on
 developing inner strength, balance,

168
00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:32.125
and purpose.

169
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:35.083
Success isn't that state

170
00:09:35.083 --> 00:09:38.750
where adverse circumstances end;

171
00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.208
it's such a mentality

172
00:09:41.208 --> 00:09:43.625
that enables you to face

173
00:09:43.625 --> 00:09:47.916
every challenge with composure.

174
00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:51.000
When your peace is internal,

175
00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:56.125
then you can fulfill any work easily.

176
00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:59.541
Then whatever position you obtain,

177
00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:03.375
even while in that position, you can focus

178
00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:04.708
on important matters

179
00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:07.375
with a stable mind!

180
00:10:07.375 --> 00:10:11.791
That person who does work considering it duty

181
00:10:11.791 --> 00:10:16.708
undoubtedly experiences peace and joy,

182
00:10:16.708 --> 00:10:22.125
whatever position they're working in.

183
00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:24.375
Think about this.
